      ],
      "extract": "Two years of work that can transform the health system in a fragile setting WHO’s response to COVID-19 in Somalia, 2020–2022: road to an inclusive recovery Two years of work that can transform the health system in a fragile setting WHO’s response to COVID-19 in Somalia, 2020–2022: road to an inclusive recovery Copyright: © WHO Somalia, September 2022 Photos © WHO Somalia/Fouzia Bano/Ismael Taxta/Arete © World Health",
