      ],
      "extract": "knowledge: translating research into actions on health The WHO country office continued to support the use of science, data and evidence in public health decisions-making for managing COVID-19 as well as to inform implementation and operational response strategies. The use of data for risk assessment and intelligence-gathering allowed the country office to promote science-based standards and tailor and target health",
      "extractCut": true
